<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Sep 25, 2003 :: Inny gives up more toys!</div><P>As usual, I didn't think to take a picture of the corpse, but went down to Nadox and killed Inny again for some fun and prizes! Grats to Varkin on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/dreadscale_cloak.jpg">Dreadscale Cloak</A> and Colwn and Grajin on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/shattered_emerald_necklace.jpg">Shattered Emerald Necklaces</A>! </P>
<P>Here's a picture from a previous kill... I present.. Inny's FEET!<BR><BR><IMG alt=FEET! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/inny.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Broodmother had to die as well, what with being in our way, and she even dropped something nice! Grats Divan on you <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/lavastone_ring.jpg">Lavastone Ring</A>. Divan passed his <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/valorium_ring_gallantry.jpg">Valorium Ring of Gallantry</A> to the guild.. grats Erowyn. Grajin tried to pass off <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/TrackingWolfCollar.jpg">his neck</A>, but nobody needed it. Thanks for trying though!! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Sep 24, 2003 :: Catching up!</div><P><FONT color=#999999 size=2>Grats Sonaddor on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Jagged_Blade_of_War.jpg">epic blades</A>! </FONT></P>
<P><FONT color=#999999 size=2><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/sonaddor.jpg" align=baseline border=0></FONT></P>
<P><FONT color=#999999><FONT size=2>Grats Tylokki on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/staff_of_the_four.JPG">wizard epicness</A>!<BR><BR><IMG alt="Frog Frog Frog!" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/tylokki.jpg" align=baseline border=0></FONT></P>
<P>Grats Arrienka on her <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">cleric epic</A>!<BR><BR><IMG alt="Epic Catwoman!" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/arrienka0.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><BR><BR><FONT size=2>It's been some time since I made note of leveling updates (or any updates for that matter). So excuse the long list, pretty much just doing leveling for now!<BR><BR>Grats Kahln on 65 and Arch Convoker! <BR>Grats Kleria, Jakr, Garacaius, Drakshar and Corbane on 64! <BR>Grats Venran and Antroe on 63! <BR>Grats Wonderous and Edko on 62! <BR>Grats Zavitar and Tryder on 61! Grats Rebequa on 59! <BR>Grats Tylokki, Thayet, Softeyes and Juhel on 57! <BR>Grats Lash on 55 and Preserver! <BR>Grats Tearani on 54! <BR>Grats Zentox and Grikgank on 52! <BR>Grats Reivan on 51 and Evoker! <BR>Grats Ewlala on 51 and Illusionist! <BR>Grats Desultor on 51 and Reaver! <BR>Grats Sallt on 49! <BR>Grats Arwiin on 46 and planes capable! <BR>Grats Shatta on 44!<BR><BR>I'm sure I missed some folks, clearly it's because I hate you...</FONT></FONT></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=13'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a> <a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a> 14 </span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
